message: "If you use this model in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Mouse Hideout for Diabetic Model Mice (3D printed, two-door arch)"
abstract: >-
  A 3D-printable hide / cover for diabetic model mice. Dome cover with an open
  bottom, a single top vent hole and two identical semicircular-arch doors,
  sized 100 x 100 x 55 mm for a 30 g adult mouse.
